# attendance_exercises/*.md and attendance_solutions/*.md are the source of
# truth for the exercise sheets; the corresponding .tex is regenerated from
# them by scripts/render_tex.sh (see .github/workflows/latex.yml) and should
# not be committed, to avoid drifting out of sync with the .md content.
# course_sheet.cls, course-info.tex and 2026-SoSe.tex are hand-maintained and
# don't start with a digit, so they are unaffected by this pattern.
# attendance_solutions/5_neural_network_solution.tex is a known exception:
# it currently has no corresponding .md source and is kept as committed,
# hand-maintained LaTeX until that is resolved.
attendance_exercises/[0-9]*.tex
attendance_solutions/[0-9]*.tex
!attendance_solutions/5_neural_network_solution.tex

# LaTeX build byproducts, in case anyone compiles locally without -outdir.
*.aux
*.fls
*.fdb_latexmk
*.out
*.synctex.gz
